cooperation of the Parties in ensuring international information security;
13) creating  conditions for cooperation between the competent authorities of
the Parties in order to implement this Agreement;
14) interacting within international organizations and fora on issues of
international information security;
15) exchanging experience, train ing of specialists, holding working meetings,
conferences, seminars and other forums of authorized representatives and experts
of the Parties in the field of information security;
16) exchanging information on issues related to the cooperation in the basic
areas listed in this Article.
By mutual agreement, the Parties or the competent authorities of the Parties
may determine other areas of cooperation.
